"smart_blocks:sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/SPC 2 - Unidad 1.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###**1\\) ¿Cómo definirías la perspectiva decolonial y cuál es su relevancia en el campo de la psicología?**": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"18h2cp9","at":1784054948262},"key":"sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/SPC 2 - Unidad 1.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###**1\\) ¿Cómo definirías la perspectiva decolonial y cuál es su relevancia en el campo de la psicología?**","lines":[118,119],"size":110,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
"smart_blocks:sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/SPC 2 - Unidad 1.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###La perspectiva decolonial se define como un ejercicio de **revisión constante e imaginación propositiva** para criticar los saberes y las prácticas disciplinares. Implica cuestionar críticamente el **ropaje de universalidad** que nutre la psicología, analizando qué saberes y prácticas conformaron su matriz disciplinar y bajo qué condiciones históricas se esgrimieron como tales. Su relevancia en la psicología radica en que permite **repensar la localización geopolítica** y las perspectivas asumidas, e interpela a las estructuras generadoras de conocimiento a revisar las maneras de hacer y transmitir ciencia.": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"17t965b","at":1784054948752},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.0186312,0.02598441,0.0500474,-0.00961192,-0.02257273,-0.00770736,0.00470032,0.02158177,0.004456,-0.01027921,-0.03396853,-0.09653067,-0.0057486,0.03453714,0.02365117,0.00553632,-0.03142102,0.0865372,-0.03039504,-0.00411491,0.18119699,-0.03074973,-0.03832726,-0.05639949,-0.00964683,0.02952101,-0.04899803,-0.01843178,-0.02914142,-0.21386436,0.02248018,-0.00039195,0.00884191,-0.002176,-0.02287568,0.01743661,-0.07702645,-0.01484554,-0.08992688,0.09511266,0.0252885,0.0248159,-0.01322095,-0.02577993,-0.05422086,-0.10924756,0.01771653,0.00297783,-0.08841719,0.00274713,-0.02263471,0.05367161,-0.015974,0.02835632,-0.02005901,0.04779067,0.0312398,0.06786538,0.02345671,0.02587035,0.08113221,0.04390826,-0.2459082,0.06180493,0.05683372,0.01576706,-0.03976157,0.0115511,-0.00082875,0.02076327,-0.04348198,0.01763724,0.03933913,0.07727312,0.05700251,0.02196954,-0.06746966,-0.00854223,-0.02208573,0.04772014,0.04575087,0.08993065,-0.05154623,-0.06290714,-0.00420312,-0.07325568,0.04524217,-0.04005112,0.0237794,0.02819168,-0.03898852,-0.03789787,0.03952747,0.02109627,-0.01345011,-0.01786842,-0.02502761,0.08880595,0.04546666,0.09678245,-0.01484315,0.003