"smart_blocks:sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/SPC 2 - Unidad 1.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###• Convertir el formato de la escritura (como la revista internacional indexada o el congreso regional) y la geografía, el género, el estatus y el idioma, en **ejes de análisis en sí mismos**.": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"11vixib","at":1784054948262},"key":"sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/SPC 2 - Unidad 1.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###• Convertir el formato de la escritura (como la revista internacional indexada o el congreso regional) y la geografía, el género, el estatus y el idioma, en **ejes de análisis en sí mismos**.","lines":[136,137],"size":197,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
"smart_blocks:sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/SPC 2 - Unidad 1.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###**4\\) ¿Cómo describen los autores el carácter interseccional de la perspectiva decolonial?**": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1424rav","at":1784054948262},"key":"sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/SPC 2 - Unidad 1.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###**4\\) ¿Cómo describen los autores el carácter interseccional de la perspectiva decolonial?**","lines":[138,139],"size":98,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
"smart_blocks:sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/SPC 2 - Unidad 1.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###Los autores describen el carácter interseccional de la perspectiva decolonial señalando que **todas las formas de colonialidad están entretejidas** de tal manera que resultan **inseparables la clase, la raza y el género**. La confluencia de estos sistemas de dominación atenta contra la diversidad y condena a los sujetos desplazados a carecer de historia, conocimiento o voz propia. La interseccionalidad ha enriquecido las teorías decoloniales al poner en evidencia que el sesgo en el discurso colonizador es tanto **imperialista como patriarcal**. Al enseñar, implica criticar, junto a la colonización científica, los **sesgos patriarcales, sexistas y heteronormativos** que se presentan bajo la apariencia de universalidad o neutralidad.": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"1ndub1b","at":1784054948809},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.01294677,0.03207723,0.04028384,-0.02171622,-0.0035353,-0.02125934,0.00086814,0.00873028,0.00435277,-0.02427049,-0.0282098,-0.10593203,0.00527726,0.06028612,0.06516681,0.00718494,-0.03142346,0.07804485,-0.06346306,0.01033386,0.15546764,-0.03727051,-0.03046892,-0.04173345,-0.04310984,0.00385551,-0.01990561,0.00537366,-0.02703856,-0.22643642,0.01316207,-0.00061818,0.00027228,-0.00858043,-0.01701929,0.01782701,-0.06178797,-0.0261826,-0.08882189,0.06331484,0.04340791,0.00959308,-0.00734734,0.00389415,-0.03256318,-0.10379366,-0.00499998,-0.01858889,-0.0879601,-0.01338041,-0.0388176,0.02955411,-0.00711092,0.0199839,-0.0429397,0.05430573,0.04292098,0.03443724,0.02841562,0.03700957,0.07514655,0.06675631,-0.23511283,0.06465053,0.05348829,0.0334718,-0.03903391,0.0234822,0.0038794,0.01366735,-0.05709395,0.01090496,0.06090955,0.06877068,0.06722593,0.0197458,-0.0537676,-0.04115907,0.00565008,0.03435636,0.07047065,0.07635532,-0.01644607,-0.0603854,0.00787403,-0.07877693,0.05620973,-0.04828683,0.00619429,-0.00147704,-0.02