teorías decoloniales al poner en evidencia que el sesgo en el discurso colonizador es tanto **imperialista como patriarcal**. Al enseñar, implica criticar, junto a la colonización científica, los **sesgos patriarcales, sexistas y heteronormativos** que se presentan bajo la apariencia de universalidad o neutralidad.","lines":[140,152],"size":3587,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
"smart_blocks:sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/SPC 2 - Unidad 1.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###Los autores describen el carácter interseccional de la perspectiva decolonial señalando que **todas las formas de colonialidad están entretejidas** de tal manera que resultan **inseparables la clase, la raza y el género**. La confluencia de estos sistemas de dominación atenta contra la diversidad y condena a los sujetos desplazados a carecer de historia, conocimiento o voz propia. La interseccionalidad ha enriquecido las teorías decoloniales al poner en evidencia que el sesgo en el discurso colonizador es tanto **imperialista como patriarcal**. Al enseñar, implica criticar, junto a la colonización científica, los **sesgos patriarcales, sexistas y heteronormativos** que se presentan bajo la apariencia de universalidad o neutralidad.#{1}": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"gwv737","at":1784054948844},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.01386384,0.03604859,0.04191937,-0.02342657,-0.00486535,-0.02188986,0.00261746,0.00983377,0.00315337,-0.02693301,-0.02767109,-0.10820585,0.0008443,0.06305388,0.06055785,0.00257364,-0.03157521,0.0809245,-0.06122706,0.0117764,0.15189259,-0.03478015,-0.02952868,-0.04232055,-0.04153622,0.00174332,-0.01895118,0.00909745,-0.0277365,-0.22552693,0.01032857,-0.00034127,0.00095522,-0.00999125,-0.01827216,0.01619005,-0.0676611,-0.03006453,-0.08711841,0.06101953,0.04813323,0.01217659,-0.00519312,0.00874098,-0.03065232,-0.1042258,-0.00765748,-0.01893594,-0.08098789,-0.01193026,-0.03849228,0.03063959,-0.00928769,0.02109282,-0.04235944,0.05391591,0.04420162,0.03561713,0.02876472,0.0396225,0.0694217,0.06958113,-0.23413278,0.06519938,0.05134426,0.03264874,-0.03750633,0.02593416,0.00278167,0.01371497,-0.05932256,0.00682114,0.05779686,0.06140947,0.06614541,0.02462106,-0.04932602,-0.04478275,0.00748326,0.03406916,0.06557648,0.07791725,-0.01621314,-0.05680433,0.00597601,-0.07355633,0.06036221,-0.04597329,0.00786416,-0.001439